      "mentions": 87,
      "title": {
        "en": "Empathetic and welcoming surgery team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers across dozens of visits praise vets like Sam and Julia alongside the nursing team for their patient, approachable care. Although two pet owners reported frustrations with appointment queues or rough handling, the broad consensus highlights a kind, supportive clinic staff."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 67,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle treatment for nervous companions"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently remark on how calm their nervous dogs and anxious cats feel during routine boosters, dental work, and neutering procedures. Pet owners appreciate the gentle handling techniques used during examinations, which help distressed animals feel safe and settled."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 33,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear explanations and transparent guidance"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently note that veterinary clinicians listen attentively to owner concerns and explain diagnostics without confusing jargon. Reviewers appreciate receiving thorough post-procedure updates and phone calls with test results, making care decisions straightforward."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Animal Trust charge a consultation fee for sick pets?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently highlight that consultations are provided without appointment fees as part of their community mission."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can appointments be booked online?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients mention that booking appointments through the online registration portal is fast and convenient."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the Ibrox surgery perform pet neutering procedures?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, pet owners report positive outcomes and thorough aftercare for dog and cat neutering and spaying surgeries."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are veterinary medicines priced affordably?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "While general care is considered affordable, one reviewer noted that specific prescription tablets carried higher costs than online pharmacies."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
